chaosshard.antechamber.first_arrival=Grimoire: Acceptance inspection started. Shard, you are in the Antechamber. Do not approach the edge: there is nothing beyond it. Nothing at all.
chaosshard.antechamber.reassembled=Grimoire: The Shard's body has been reassembled. The cost has been billed against your future victories.

chaosshard.thread.levelup.1=Grimoire: The Thread is taut (level %s). Lord Death hears you. Do not flatter yourself — he only hears.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.2=Grimoire: The Thread grows stronger (level %s). The Lord has deigned to notice your existence. Recorded.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.3=Grimoire: The link is stable (level %s). You may now do more than befits a unit of your class.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.4=Grimoire: The Thread sings (level %s). The Lord is pleased. I reservedly do not object.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.5=Grimoire: The Thread is at full strength (level %s). You are an extension of Lord Death's will. Behave accordingly.
chaosshard.hud.thread=Thread %s · %s/%s
chaosshard.hud.thread.max=Thread %s · max

